WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.094
Media used to plan, buy and report on paid space.

00:00:04.144 --> 00:00:09.165
Now it orchestrates whole experiences across owned, earned, shared and paid.

00:00:09.215 --> 00:00:10.954
That's the shift.

00:00:11.667 --> 00:00:12.973
Why the change?

00:00:13.023 --> 00:00:18.174
More channels, more specialists, tighter budgets, and a data boom under privacy laws.

00:00:18.224 --> 00:00:21.905
Creative and media agencies now compete for strategy.

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:24.107
NRMA's highway campaign did all four:

00:00:24.157 --> 00:00:26.359
a paid news partnership,

00:00:26.409 --> 00:00:27.220
earned coverage,

00:00:27.270 --> 00:00:28.128
shared talk,

00:00:28.178 --> 00:00:29.790
and its own channels.

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:36.170
Use it like this: plan all four connections together, not paid media alone.
